#   treeline-release namespaces="treeline-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
#
# THIS FILE HAS NO KEY YET. The owner makes one (docs/DEPLOY_AWS.md, "Release signing"), puts the private half in the
# protected GitHub environment and pastes the public line here, in a commit of its own. install.sh refuses to
